      "WebArena Agent Execution Traces (https://github.com/web-arena-x/webarena/blob/main/resources/README.md)",
      "What’s New in WCAG 2.2, W3C WAI (https://www.w3.org/WAI/standards-guidelines/wcag/new-in-22/)",
